# ludic.cars - wheeled vehicles as data and a simulation behind ports: cars, trucks, buses, motorcycles
# and bicycles from CarModels rows (engine curve, gears, brakes, steering, axles, tyres, aero), tuning
# parts, paint, classes; a raycast-wheel model over the game's physics body, a planar model and a lane
# follower at a distance; entering, leaving and carjacking as a machine; ownership, garages, insurance
# and the impound; snapshots for a party. Uses ludic.base and nothing else.
package "ludic.cars"
version "0.1.0"
kind source
